window.products.push({"id":221010,"name":"2PACKS Cooling Towel,40\"x12\" Snap Cooling Towel for Sports, Workout, Fitness, Gym, Yoga, Pilates, Travel, Camping & More (Blue) (Blue-2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kdwF8NWxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QIDIANTRADE cooling towels are different from traditional towels. They are easy to clean and wash and due to the superior material with the feature of cooling your body quickly. It is a best choice for sports fans and outdoor workers. The super absorbent QIDIANTRADE cooling towel provides cooling effect through the evaporation of absorbed water to keep you comfortable up to several hours. This new technology will give a new experience for your gym sessions and hot summer time. Highlights of the QIDIANTRADE cooling towel: ❖ LONGER, 40 inches long, could be used as a scarf. ❖ SUPER SOFT, it is different from most of the old style cooling towels that are crunchy hard when dry. QIDIANTRADE cooling towel is always soft both wet and dry. ❖ ABSORBENT AND BREATHABLE, the special mesh fabric retains enough water that is required for the cooling effect. And it is breathable comfortable to skin. ❖ SIMPLY SNAP IT THREE TIMES, it cools, up to 30 degree below body temperature and it lasts for up to 3 hours until the next rehydration if not under direct sun. ❖ HIGH QUALITY EDGE STITCHING, towel edge is improved to avoid any possible sloppy threads. ❖ Occasions:For sports & exercise: running, trekking, camping, hiking, backpacking, cycling, racing, bowling, yoga, golf, fitness, landscaping, gardening, mowing the lawn, fishing, swimming, basketball, football, rugby, softball, baseball, tennis, volleyball, hockey, boxing, traveling, climbing, cheerleading, weightlifting, rowing, hunting, shooting, beach, etc. ❖ For daily life: cooling while absorbing sweat for kitchen staff, outdoor workers, sports enthusiasts, mom with baby (a cooling towel between mom and baby works wonders) Size: 100*30cm / 40*12inches Proudly designed in the USA! Simply click the Add to Cart Button Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kdwF8NWxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooling Towel","source_asin":"B08BHRC2TP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BHRC2TP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BHRC2TP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":221011,"name":"Gilbins 100% Combed T-Shirt Cotton Jersey Knit Camp Sheet Set, 1 Fitted cot Sheet, 1 Flat Sheet, 1 Standard Pillow case Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IcqPoNwIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% combed cotton sheet set. This Jersey Knit Cotton Fitted sheet set is so soft, you'll never want to get out of bed. Light weight, cool comfort Cotton fabric with four-way stretch. As soft and comfortable as your favorite workout gear easy-care, wrinkle-free sheets, resistant to shrinkage and fading wicks away moisture awesome choice of colors bleach-friendly fabric Cot vs Twin: Whats's the difference? Cots are typically narrower than a standard twin bed. Twin sheets will fit a cot, however they will not fit neatly and snuggly. This will cause them to move around more, potentially come loose and make it harder to make up your bed in the morning, Most camps use cot size beds. You should consult your camp to verify This sheets is designed to fit mattresses that are sized 33 x 75. You can use this sheets on most camping cots, R/V bunk beds, home cots, boat bunks, roll-away-beds, foldaway beds, foam sleeping pads, sleeper chair mattresses, camper bunks, love seat mattresses and many other travel-sized mattresses. Always be sure to check your mattress dimensions before ordering because mattresses can be sized differently. Size Info: Cot Size Fitted Sheet 33 x 75 x 8. Size of Flat Sheet 60\" x 90\" , Twin Size Fitted Sheet 39 x 75 x 8. Size of Flat Sheet 60\" x 90\" Machine washable/ tumble dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IcqPoNwIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gilbins","source_asin":"B01DUQVPGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DUQVPGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DUQVPGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":221012,"name":"daguizu Reading Pillows Sitting Ubed for Adults,31 in Big Back Pillow for Bed TV-Shredded Memory Foam,Backrest Removable Cover Husband Pillow with Arm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mChhdoOJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to Clean: The floor pillows seating for adults comes with a velour outer cover that is zippered for easy removal and machine washable, making it perfect for quick cleanup of any spills or stains. Soft and Comfortable Premium Material: The product is made of soft, thick, and skin-friendly bright velvet that can be easily washed in a machine. The inner layer is filled with Memory cotton and silk wool, making it soft and resistant to collapsing. The fabric is also machine washable for convenience and comfort. Wide Range of Applications: making it suitable for people of all ages to use while reading, watching TV, or playing games on the bed, sofa, or carpet. It provides users with a relaxing and comfortable experience. Versatile Comfort: The reading & bed rest pillows are designed to provide comfortable back support while reading, watching TV, or surfing the internet in bed. Made of medical-grade material, it is ideal for those who need to elevate their upper body for more comfort while resting or sleeping. GUARANTEE: DAGUIZU offers a no-hassle 100%! policy, ensuring complete customer satisfaction. If you use the DAGUIZU Reading Pillow and do not love it, return it for a full refund, even if it has been used. Add one to your cart today for the ultimate comfort and relaxation experience. Best Packaging: The shredded foam inside the pillow can be loosened by shaking it vigorously for 5 minutes or placing it in the dryer (no heat) with two clean tennis balls for 5 minutes. After 24-48 hours, the pillow provides firm back support, reducing stress on joints and muscles for optimum comfort. Best Resting Pillow and Beyond: The sit up pillow for bed features fabric handles for easy portability and an extra back pocket to store your glasses, phone, magazines, neck rolls, and other essentials","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mChhdoOJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"daguizu","source_asin":"B0BVBV6C7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVBV6C7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVBV6C7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
