window.products.push({"id":221191,"name":"PetOde Clothes Folder, Full/Queen, Blackwatch Plaid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KXh-+pFYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Top the bed with Pinzon’s cozy flannel duvet for great looks and a great feel against the skin. Made in Portugal from 100 percent cotton, with a flannel weight of 160 grams per square meter, the fabric is lightly brushed for a soft, supple touch and is pre-washed for durability. The Full/Queen duvet measures 86 by 86 inches. It has a hidden button closure for securing a comforter and is machine washable and dryable. This high-quality fabric begins with dyed yarns, so the plaid patterning is woven through and appears on both sides. Offered in an array of colors, the duvet coordinates with Pinzon 160-Gram Yarn-Dyed Plaid Flannel sheets and shams, or it mixes and matches with Pinzon solid flannels. Peruse the wide variety of Pinzon solid, printed, and yard-dyed flannel bedding to create a layered look with an ultra-soft feel. Fabric Definition Flannel: Flannel fabrics are noted for their fuzzy softness, warmth, and durability, and they can be dyed or printed. Thought to have been popularized in Wales in the 17th century, flannel was an all-wool fabric made of woolen or worsted yarns, with a brushed surface and a soft napped finish obscuring its weave. Flannel may be plain woven or twill woven and, today, most flannel fabrics are made of cotton fibers or synthetic rayon fibers that are slightly napped on both sides to resemble the old woolen or worsted yarn weaves. A wide range of flannel weights and textures is available. The fabric weight and quality of the napping affect the warmth and softness of the fabric. Many people prefer flannel bedding during the cold, winter months, but some flannel weights are appropriate in breathability and comfort all year long. An Amazon Brand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KXh-+pFYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B001V9LBAC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001V9LBAC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001V9LBAC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":221192,"name":"Findigit Ergonomic Cervical Orthopedic Sleep Neck Pillow for Neck Shoulder Pain , Side Sleeper Neck Contour Support Memory Foam Pillow for Side Front ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zqWd4t4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌛【100% PREMIUM MEMORY FOAM PILLOW】: Findigit ergonomic sleeping pillow core is made of high- density slow rebound memory foam. That will provide sleeping firm support with amazing comfort and softness. 🌛【2-in-1 HEIGHT】: 3.6\" for back and stomach sleepers or low pillow lovers, and 4.3\" for back and side sleepers or high pillow lovers. The cervical pillow can evenly distributes the pressure and traction the cervical spine that lending to a better blood flow. Perfect balance between comfort and support feels like sleeping on the clouds. 🌛【REDUCE NECK & BACK PAIN】: Proven contour design perfectly supports and aligns your head, neck, shoulder, and back. Bringing a reduction of stress in the cervical vertebra and spine. Improving sleep and relieving neck and shoulder pain, discomfort rejuvenating your body. 🌛【BREATHABLE & SKIN-FREINDLY PILLOWCASE】: Pillowcase made of super comfortable breathable fabric will give you cooling feel. The breathable inner cover extends the life of memory foam core effectively. Outer cover is machine-washed. 🌛【KIND REMINDER】: Our pillows are safe and hypoallergenic, after receiving the pillow, please open the package and wash the pillowcase, place the pillow on a ventilated place for 1-2 days in case there is a memory foam smell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zqWd4t4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Findigit","source_asin":"B0B4WD763K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4WD763K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4WD763K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":221193,"name":"SUPERIOR Linen Textured Blackout Curtain Set of 2, Thermal Insulated Panel Pair with Grommet Top Header, Classic Natural Look Room Darkening Drapes, A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918wwndZ4yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Affordable Luxury Linens Superior is excited to introduce our new line of exquisite Linen blackout curtain panel pairs. Sleep better with our newest thermal insulated blackout curtains which help to darken a room by blocking up to 70% of sunlight and UV rays, making these curtains a necessity for bright winter mornings and summer nights. Our curtains feature a triple-weave construction with room-darkening threads built into the fabric, for a thicker and more lush-looking curtain. The material has a gorgeous drape that looks beautiful puddled, tied back, and gathered, without appearing excessively heavy or bulky. These woven blackout curtains are available in a wide variety of patterns, textures, and solid colors with both modern and classic styles to fit your décor. From classically chic linen-textured and solid, to elegant embossed waverly and jacquard leaves, to contemporary metallic shimmer, our beautiful woven blackout curtains will add the perfect finishing touch to reflect your personal style. Available in 4 different lengths 63” to 108”, Superior’s range of curtains features a wide variety of styles to help you find the perfect curtains for any room, from a casual child’s bedroom to a luxurious formal dining room.   The sandwiched inner core of black light-blocking fibers in our thermal blackout curtains insulate rooms by trapping in heat during the winter and keeping heat and light out during the summer. Blackout curtains aid in saving energy and lowering utility bills by blocking out most light and UV rays, and by reducing the amount of thermal energy that escapes through windows. These curtain panels are easily machine washable. They are fade, wrinkle and shrink resistant. Wash Cold, Gentle cycle, tumble dry low, do not bleach, and use a warm iron when needed. Features: Thermal insulated panels that blocks the suns UV rays Thermal insulated panels that blocks the suns UV rays Hem size - top 3.74\" bottom 1.96 side 0.98\" Hem size - top 3.74\" bottom 1.96 side 0.98\" 8 stainless grommets of 1.57\" diameter 8 stainless grommets of 1.57\" diameter Pattern: Linen. 2 panels in one package Pattern: Linen. 2 panels in one package Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bedskirts, to towels and bath robes, comforters and mattress toppers, curtains and drapes, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918wwndZ4yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B077Y7VQL3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077Y7VQL3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077Y7VQL3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
