window.products.push({"id":221201,"name":"Lunch Bag, KOMUEE Insulated Lunch Box Wide-Open Lunch Tote Bag Large Drinks Holder Durable Nylon Thermal Snacks Organizer for Women Men Adults College","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z33COU3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HUGE CAPACITY: KOMUEE lunch bags can accommodate a wide variety of things including salads, snacks, fruit, drinks and lunch boxes. You can hold 2 lunch containers and 2 bottle of drinks in the lunch bag.It can fit all your lunch needs. PRACTICAL FUNCTION & HIGH QUALITY: KOMUEE lunch bags lining is made of insulated material, which keeps food and drinks warm & fresh for 3 to 24 hours , so you can enjoy fresh food at any time.The use of Eco-friendly EVA material makes it easy to wipe clean, waterproof and leak-proof. Cotton and linen handles are lightweight and portable,the nylon connect by dense stitching makes the lunch bag very durable and safe to carry lunch. EXCELLENT DESIGN: Wide open design is beneficial to put your lunch boxes into the bag or take out of the lunch bag, avoiding liquid leaking out of food containers and soiling inside of the bag. Save your cleaning time.And the design of the pockets, for you to place small objects. SUITABLE FOR MANY OCCASIONS: The unisex lunch bag is not only suitable for work and college, but also for outdoor activities such as fishing, hiking and more. It can also be used as a picnic bag and a snack pack. Suitable for all groups, designed for students, office workers and outdoor enthusiasts. SATISFICING SERVICE: Customer Satisfaction is our top priority. KOMUEE insists on the highest quality materials and manufacturing processes to bring you superior kitchen accessories. Quality products and exquisite packaging will provide you with a satisfying purchasing experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z33COU3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOMUEE","source_asin":"B07QLM94JV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QLM94JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QLM94JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":221202,"name":"Elviros Memory Foam Cervical Pillow, Ergonomic Contour Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain Relief, Orthopedic Sleeping Bed Pillows for Side Sleepers, Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BUzkhUJwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌙ERGONOMIC DESIGN: The pillow holds the head anatomically correct in sleeping positions. It fits the neck curve, allowing the neck to bend naturally. The spine, head and neck area are ideally and correctly supported. The cutouts on the side give your top arm a place to rest and keep it at an angle so your shoulder is not hunching over in front of you. 🌙AWAY FROM NECK & SHOULDER PAIN: This cervical pillow is made of high quality memory foam with moderate hardness and softness, increased isolated pressure distribution. Relaxing the neck pain and shoulder stiffness, helping you sleep through the night neck pain-free, and gently stretching and relieving your shoulder muscles, while supporting your neck. 🌙ADJUSTABLE HEIGHT---DESIGNED FOR BACK & SIDE SLEEPING: SIZE:64*(12.5/10.5)*36cm/25.2 x (4.1/4.9)*14.2inch (L*H*W), Back sleepers with cervical issues can sleep on the higher side of the pillow with 2 horns as this side provides better support for the head and cervical, so as to keep your neck properly aligned with the rest of your body. All the other back/side sleepers can sleep on the lower side. 🌙PURE NATURAL PREMIUM MEMORY FOAM: Pillow core is made of high-density slow rebound memory foam, meets the CertiPUR-US standards. Uniformly punched and distributed to increase air circulation, breathable and skin-friendly. Maintaining both amazing softness and firmness under high usage rate and various environments. THE MEMORY FOAM ITSELF WILL HAVE A VERY LIGHT SMELL, IF YOU ARE UNACCEPTABLE, PLEASE VENTILABLE IT FOR 3-5 DAYS. 🌙REMOVABLE BREATHABLE PILLOWCASE: made of 100% polyester fiber. It is a detachable zipper and machine washable, durable and resilient, easy to clean and keep hygiene. All materials do not contain chemical substances, which can improve health. 🌙SUITABLE FOR ALL KINDS OF PEOPLE: This neck support pillow is very suitable for elders, office workers, teachers, and those who suffer from sleep disorders. If you have chronic cervical spondylosis, the delicate neck support pillow will be the optimum choice for providing comfortable sleep and relieving the pain of the cervical vertebra. 🌙INSTRUCTIONS: Before first use, unzip and remove the lid and leave the memory foam flat in a well-ventilated area for 1 to 24 hours until it fully expands. 🌙WARM TIPS: The pillow cannot be used to treat cervical spondylosis. If you want to use it for medical rehabilitation, please consult a professional doctor and decide whether to buy it according to the doctor’s recommendation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BUzkhUJwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elviros","source_asin":"B093BHPTWL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093BHPTWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093BHPTWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
