window.products.push({"id":221240,"name":"Vacuum Sealer Machine, Bonsenkitchen Food Vacuum Machine for Food, Built-in Cutter & Roll Storage, Air Vacuumed Sealing Design with Dry & Moist Modes,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GUtLDXgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dual Sealing Modes: Bonsenkitchen vacuum sealing system is cleverly designed owning two selectable modes to provide your food with the best possible preservation based on the type of food you want to seal. You can choose the dry indication for solid food items and the moist indication for poached, simmered or steamed food. Keep Food Fresh Longer: Bonsenkitchen food vacuum sealer removes air from vacuum bags effectively. Multi-layer material heat seals to keep air out and can keep food fresh, reduce food waste. Food Vacuum Sealer machine keeps food fresh in the freezer up to 5x longer compared to ordinary storage methods and helps prevent freezer burn as well. Built-in Cutter & Roll Storage & Cable Holder: Convenient roll storage with built in cutter lets you easily create custom-sized bags just place the bag properly and move the slidable cutter from one end to another. Compact cable holder design is easy to organize. Simple to Operate: Bonsenkitchen vacuum sealer machine is very friendly for the beginner. Simply put your food of choice into a pre-cut or rolled vacuum sealer bag, season as desired, insert opened end of bag to vacuum food sealer and choose the mode you need. Wait for 10-20 seconds and the vacuum sealing is completed. A full starter kit : Apart from the food vacuum sealer and user manual, Bonsenkitchen vacuum sealer package also includes 1 x Vacuum Roll Bag( 11 x 118 IN), 5 x Vacuum Sealer Bags (7.87x11.8 IN), 5 x Zipper Bags (9.84x11.02IN), 2 x Vacuum Hose, 1x Wine Cork.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GUtLDXgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonsenkitchen","source_asin":"B09F69SM4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F69SM4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F69SM4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
