window.products.push({"id":221242,"name":"Benlight Slushy Cup | Travel Portable Instant Slushie Maker Cup Double Layer | TIK TOK Quick Frozen Magic Squeeze Cup | Homemade Milk Shake Coca Cola ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ImcOGcC6L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"🥤 SUMMER QUICK ICE MAKER: Built in freezing liquid inside the slushie cup & their ingredients are exchanged for heat and cold to make it delicious & funny. Freezing liquid turn any drink into a smoothie cup and squeeze it to enjoy your favorite slush (Milk shakes, cola, soda and juices) within minutes. 🥤 TWO IN ONE-STRAW & SPOON: Spoon is connected to the straw of slush cup that can be used either as a spoon or a straw, meeting your different needs for smoothies’ lovers! 🥤 REUSABLE & FOOD GRADE MATERIAL: Slushy cup maker is made of BPA free, food grade safe and non-deformable silicone material. With a large capacity, it is washable after each use, just simply clean it with water & put it in refrigerator to reuse again. The built in condensate freezing liquid have a shelf life of 12 months. 🥤 EASY TO USE: Freeze the slushie cup in freezer about 3-6 hours before making slushy. Take it out and simply pour in your favorite drink & squeezes gently with lid covered, your slushy will be ready instantly. Enjoy the slushy party by adding different flavors according to taste!! 🥤 FUN CREATIVE GIFT: Everyone can enjoy the smoothies at home with this ice slushie maker cup as there is no complicated steps involved. These slushie cups disposable are a creative gift for children, friends and family during the summer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ImcOGcC6L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Benlight","source_asin":"B09Q6HGWW7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q6HGWW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q6HGWW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":221243,"name":"OasisSpace Wedge Pillows for After Surgery - 4pcs Orthopedic Wedge Pillow Set, Memory Foam Sleeping Wedges for Adults, Sitting Pillow for Acid Reflux ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tdivu5pZL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Versatile Application Design - Consisted with 4 parts, OasisSpace bed wedge pillow can be set to versatile combinations for your need. With 2 wedge pillow parts of different thickness and 2 bolsters, you can choose what angle you want to sleep at. It is perfect for relaxing, reading, watching TV, or trying to find the right sleep position. Premium Breathable Memory Foam - Made of 45D memory foam, OasisSpace wedge pillow for sleeping is firm enough to maintain its shape for a long time without deformation. It also soft enough to fit the contours of the body. This pillow provides you the proper posture to lay on for supporting neck, lower back, legs and knees. Washable Velvet Cover - OasisSpace orthopedic bed wedge pillow comes with removable cover of high quality plush fabric , it's very comfortable and non-irritated to sensitive skin. Unlike the Velcro of other pillows, our hidden button design will not rub your skin when sleeping. (Reminder: Since the pillow was vacuum packaging, it may take a few hours to bounce back after the package is removed.) Improve Health and Sleep Quality - Orthopedic Bed Wedge Pillow Set is ergonomic designed for full-body relaxation. You can use it to promote a healthier posture, help reduce neck pain, increase blood flow, promote breathing, reduce snoring and heartburn when sleeping at night, which allows you wake up pain free in morning. Perfect Gift Choice - You can rest assured that our adjustable pillow for acid reflux will not deform with the passage of time. To satisfy our dear customers, we do a good job in terms of comfort, quality and customer service. Our products have 1 YEAR WARRANTY. Don't hesitate to reach out and use them! This will be a wonderful gift for you and your family. Sleep problems won't bother you anymore.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tdivu5pZL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OasisSpace","source_asin":"B09PD9TMT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PD9TMT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PD9TMT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
