window.products.push({"id":221268,"name":"Native Fab Set of 12 Kitchen Dish Towels 100% Cotton 16x26- Absorbent Tea Towels, Dish Cloths, Restaurant Cleaning Towels, Buffalo Plaid Kitchen Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81meQjIhmyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your kitchen decor with the addition of our set of 12 Buffalo Checkered towels made from 100% premium cotton. Created from first-rate cotton, these kitchen towels are highly absorbent, robust, and long-lasting. The trendy buffalo checkered texture lends a sophisticated touch to your kitchen decor, while their superior drying ability makes them perfect for handling utensils, cutlery, and wiping counters. Our tea towels flaunt a stylish checkered pattern that comes in a variety of colors to match any kitchen style. The checks provide a modern twist, making them suitable for both contemporary and traditional kitchens. Select your preferred shade or one that complements your overall kitchen aesthetic. Our kitchen towels have a generous size of 16x26 inches, so they're the perfect size for cleaning larger dishes and utensils. They're also great for drying hands and wiping surfaces, ensuring you have sufficient coverage for any kitchen task. The generous size makes them effortless to fold, hang, and store. You'll love how our tea towels are machine washable, so you never have to worry about losing their absorbency or vibrant color after multiple washes. Furthermore, our towels are lint-free, ensuring that they won't leave any fluff or debris on your kitchenware or counters. In addition to their practical features, our 100% Cotton Buffalo Checkered towels are eco-friendly. Made of cotton, these towels are biodegradable and recyclable, making them a sustainable choice for your kitchen. Our pack of 12 dish towels provides an ideal balance of style, functionality, and durability, making them a wise investment for your home. Whether you're drying dishes, wiping counters, or simply sprucing up your kitchen, these towels will make your kitchen chores easy, quick, and stylish. Place your order today and give your kitchen a fashionable and useful upgrade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81meQjIhmyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Native Fab","source_asin":"B08KLV3ZWD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KLV3ZWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KLV3ZWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":221269,"name":"Hisip Electric Wine Opener Set, Corkscrew Wine Bottle Opener with Wine Aerator Pourer Foil Cutter, Vacuum Wine Stoppers for Wine Lover Christmas Gift ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7153LuXjyKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMBO WINE OPENER GIFT SET: includes electric wine bottle opener, wine pump, wine foil cutter, wine aerator pourers, vacuum wine stopper. It is a very complete wine gift set that includes everything from opening, serving to good storage BRING OUT YOUR WINE'S NATURAL BOUQUET: The Wine aerator pourer increases the volume of contact with the air, aerating your wine allows your wine to breathe, enhancing the taste and improving the bouquet. The 2 in 1 tulip-shaped pourer included in this wine opener set helps the wine pouring evenly and faster, ensuring drip-free wine pouring, you can enjoy your wine faster as there is no need to pour the wine into a decanter and set aside for a long period of time. SIMPLE PUSH-BUTTON OPERATION: This automatic wine opener removes the cork in 5--7 seconds and ejects it from the corkscrew by pressing the “Release” and “Extract” button. Great for dinner parties and large gatherings, simply take off the foil with foil cutter, exposing the cork. This effortless electric corkscrew features see-through window for easy viewing the LED light when it works. (battery not included) SIMPLE SEAL REMOVER AND PRESERVE: Our wine foil cutter with razor sharp blades requires just a simple squeeze and twist. The cutter can be stored at the storage stand. The vacuum stopper helps to preserve the wine after the first opening. It sucks out the air inside the wine bottle, creating an internal vacuum that keeps the inherent flavor to avoid air degrading the wine quality. It is designed quite compactly, convenient for use and preservation. PERFECT GIFT FOR ANY OCCASION: The wine openers is a great present for any wine lovers, friends, family. Suitable for birthday, wedding, anniversary, housewarming, wine tasting party, bachelor party and many else. The combination of this wine bottle opener worked effectively making a wine opener that would suit tasteful gatherings or arrangements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7153LuXjyKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hisip","source_asin":"B0B59G85CP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B59G85CP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B59G85CP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
