window.products.push({"id":221273,"name":"Pinelive 700+ Large Recipe Box with Cards and Dividers Plus Phone/iPad Holder! Pine Wooden Recipe Box Organizer. Recipe Card Box with 100 Index Recipe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XZsnIfhCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ONLY FOR SERIOUS RECIPE LOVERS: With space inside for over 700 Recipes, and slots on top for 4 recipe cards and TWO cellphones (or iPad), this recipe organizer is for those who ADORE cooking feasts and LOVE recipes in an ABUNDANT way! Perhaps you’ve got too many? And that’s ok too, because when it’s time to declutter… this recipe keeper with 100 Index Cards AND 16 Dividers is also built for YOU! EXACTLY HOW MUCH DOES IT FIT? The entire wood box is 13.6” across and 6.9” deep. It features a middle wood divider, so you can fit 350+ recipe cards on each side. Inside, your box is 5.3” tall, and we all know that’s plenty of room for those tab divider cards, 4x6 recipe cards, 3x5 recipe cards, notebook pages folded up, and even all those special recipes you have sellotaped in plastic or laminated. KEEP THEM CLEAN, AS YOU COOK: At the start of your kitchen extravaganza you can pop 4 recipe cards into the handy 1/16” recipe holder. Entrée, Main, Sauce and Dessert all at your fingertips. And the 0.86” slot lets you access everything else (room for 2 phones or a 12.9” iPad)! There’s no need to touch your recipes with sticky hands until you’re all done, and cleaned up – pristine and preserved. RECIPE CARDS AND BOX GIFT SET: Not only is the 700+ Farmhouse Recipe Box the largest you’ve seen, it’s a total gift set too. It comes with 100x double-sided recipe cards, 16x Recipe Card Dividers with tabs and 1x handy conversion card for “good measure”. You (or whoever you’re gifting it to) can personalize their categories to what works best, because the dividers feature blank tabs to write on. BIG, STRONG AND BEAUTIFUL: Durable construction (your box is firmly nailed AND glued for long term sturdiness) and the most space you can imagine, this is a heavy duty recipe box, for those who love living the heavy duty recipe life! It also comes with a 30-Day Money Back Guarantee, so why not try it now and fill it up with your most delicious secrets!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XZsnIfhCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PINELIVE","source_asin":"B085MLL62K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085MLL62K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085MLL62K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":221274,"name":"Rusticity® Wood Rolling Pin Ideal for Baking Needs - Used by Bakers & Cooks for Pasta, Cookie Dough, Pastry, Bakery, Pizza, Fondant, Chapati | Aacia &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zWgeSWx9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It is never too early nor too late to renovate your kitchen and dining area with a few rustic additions to complement your wooden spatulas and sun-kissed cabinets. With its rich brown colour, streamlined handcarved body and a wooden tree trunk texture, Rusticity’s wooden rolling pin skilfully handcrafted by rural artisans from remote villages in India has a lot to offer in terms of the desired rustic touch to your kitchen. The tools are made of premium food-grade quality hardwood which does not harm any edible product you use it for, and tapered edges ensure smooth rolling. A perfect accessory to possess in your kitchen collection. Rusticity stands for the quality of being rustic. We are an international brand of traditional products handcrafted for modern use. Our products are created to add a traditional rustic flavor to your lives at the same time creating modern usability and value. All our products are sourced in a fair and responsible manner and provide some highly needed support to these traditional arts and crafts that are dying. *Since these are handcrafted, each individual unit may vary slightly from each other","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zWgeSWx9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rusticity","source_asin":"B07BQXDHLB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BQXDHLB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BQXDHLB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":221275,"name":"russell+hazel Acrylic and Gold Magnets, Home and Work Office Organization and Decoration, 6 Count, 62856","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313EXUuEh7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"With their minimalist design and practical, ergonomic shape, this set of 6 Acrylic and Gold Magnets will bring you much ease in putting up photos and notes in your home or work office. The magnets feature a minimalist design including a gold magnet core wrapped inside a clear acrylic casing, and they boast an elegant round shape that provides extra grip and gives you better control of where to place them on the board. Subtle gold and clear hues will enhance your pictures to elevate the look and feel of your space. Use these in combination with our Acrylic Wall Memo Board or the Acrylic Magnetic Memo Wall Strip to complete the upscale, coordinated office look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313EXUuEh7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUSSELL+HAZEL","source_asin":"B0C1JC5K7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1JC5K7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1JC5K7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
