window.products.push({"id":221345,"name":"Stainless Steel Baking Sheet Cooling Rack with Silicone Baking Mat Set, CEKEE Cookie Sheets Set of 9 (3 Sheets + 3 Baking Racks + 3 Mats), Baking Pans","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NxJXzWXaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【HEALTHY & DURABLE MATERIAL】CEKEE baking sheets for oven and cooling rack are made of premium stainless steel, without coating, wouldn't create chemicals and rust & warp resistan at high-temperature baking, so durable for long time. The silicone baking mat is made of food grade silicone and reinforced fiberglass, can withstand temperatures ranging from -40°F to up to 500°F, scratch resistant and dishwasher safe. 【UNIQUE CORRUGATED SURFACE 】The corrugated surface of the sheet pans for baking not only can promote internal airflow and heat up evenly, but also reduce the risk of food sticking. This design also strengthen the structure the baking sheets, preventing warping during the baking process. And the smooth rolled edge design avoids scratching your hands. 【 COMPLETE BAKING SET】 Cookie sheets for baking is 9 pieces, which includes 3 different sizes baking trays : Jelly roll pan (16 x 12 x 1 inch), Quarter sheet pan (12 x 10 x 1 inch) and Small baking sheet ( 9 x 7 x 1 inch). And, there are 3 sizes of cooling racks for cooking and baking and silicone baking mat corresponding to the pairing, meeting all your baking needs. 【DISHWASHER SAFE & EASY CLEAN】 Stainless steel baking tray baking rack with silicone mats for baking set is smooth, non-sticky and mirror finish, so when cleaning small rimmed baking sheet, gently scrub with soapy water only. And as long as you fully remove any oil/grease each use, baking sheet with rack and baking mat will remain bright and clean. And these baking sets are all dishwasher safe, too. 【MULTI-USE SATISFY BAKING NEEDS 】The multi-size baking pan set has MULTI COMBINATIONS, which can meet the all your baking needs in different situations, such as baking bacon, bread, cooling cookies and cakes and draining water and oil and so on. CEKEE cookie sheets for baking nonstick set makes you cooking happily and easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NxJXzWXaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CEKEE","source_asin":"B0BDG58DQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDG58DQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDG58DQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
