window.products.push({"id":221391,"name":"AHUONEL 3 Tier Tea Bag Organizer Tea Holder, Tea Bag Storage Box Tea Bag Holder Stand with 9 Compartments, Wall Mount Tea Organizer for Tea Bags, Coff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bI0OA0dOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Sturdy & Stylish Tea Bag Organizer】- A perfect combination of sturdy iron and solid wood with a blend of elegant black and vintage brown, our tea holder is not only durable and long-lasting, 3-tier standing design makes our tea organizer look unique, classic and attractive, in your kitchen, dining room or office, it is definitely an eye-catching tea bag holder. 【High Capacity Tea Organizer for Tea Bags】- 3 tier with 9 removable metal baskets provide plenty of space to store and organize tea bags, coffee, spices. Each basket can be individually taken out for cleaning and organizing, then easily be placed on the shelf, or you can remove the tea bags directly from the basket, very convenient to use. 【Wall-mounted or Countertop Tea Storage】- This vertical tea box can be placed in two ways, you can put it directly on the countertop or perfectly matched with the cabinet, or you can hang it directly on the hook or wall by removing the wooden base below, leaving only the metal bar for hanging towel, spoon, rag. It can also help you save space and meet the needs of your different space requirements. 【Versatile tea organizer for tea bags】- Our tea bag storage is multi-functional and can not only be used to store tea bags, coffee pods, creamer, sugar packets, but also can hold condiments, pepper packets, salt, spices, pepper, etc. It is perfect to be used as a countertop rack on coffee table, dining table or wall-mounted shelf in office, pantry, kitchen, break room, bathroom, craft room, kids room, bedroom, vanity, coffee shops, closet and more. 【Excellent Gift Choice for Tea Lover】- This dual-purpose and special tea holder is an amazing and thoughtful gift for friend or family who loves tea on Father's Day, Mother's Day, Birthday, Christmas or other special occasions. And if you have any problem with our tea bag organizer, you can feel free to contact us, we will provide you a satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bI0OA0dOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AHUONEL","source_asin":"B0BKPKB71Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKPKB71Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKPKB71Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
