window.products.push({"id":221497,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 9.8*7.9inch Big Size Non-stick Disposable Air Fryer Liners, Baking Paper for Air Fryer Oil-proof (100Pcs-7.9inch, Na","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AlmoAduvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Healthy & Reliable Material]: Air fryer liner parchment paper is made from unbleached pure wood pulp with food-grade silicone coating and strict quality standards, waterproof and non-stick. High temperature resistance up to 450 degrees. [Keep The Air Fryer Clean]: Disposable air fryer parchment paper are waterproof and oil-proof, and are a great way to isolate oil stains and remove food from the fryer. The air fryer is easy to clean after use and will help you to get rid of the trouble of cleaning. [Wide Application]: Air fryer parchment paper liner is resistant to heat, water and oil, suitable for air fryer, microwave oven, oven, frying pan, steamer, baking etc. Enjoy your delicious food at home baking, camping, barbecues, and parties! [Easy to Use]: These Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner are round, just in line with the shape of most fryer pans. When you need to make some food, you only need to put the food neatly on the liner paper, and then put the liner paper into the fryer, and you are ready to operate. [Warm Prompt]: Do not add air fryer liners while the air fryer is in preheat mode. After the air fryer is preheated, add paper and food. Preheating will produce strong hot air, do not let the paper contact the heating tube, otherwise there will be the so-called paper burning situation. Unbleached air fryer liners are disposable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AlmoAduvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Via Lactea","source_asin":"B09QGDWMR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QGDWMR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QGDWMR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
