window.products.push({"id":221574,"name":"Sushi Making Kit For Beginners - 22 Piece DIY Sushi Roller Kit with Bamboo Sushi Rolling Mat, Sushi Bazooka, Chef's Knife, Chopsticks, Holder - Best S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+Am-w9IhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to Use - DIY Beginner Friendly - Express your creativity in the kitchen and enjoy family bonding time as kids & adults all take part in dazzling displays of sushi artistry. Beginner friendly DIY sushi kit is great for gatherings of friends or date nights. Share the laughter and joy while saving money and learning new skills. Discover your tradition! This sushi making kit comes with: 1 x Sushi Bazooka 2 x Sushi Matts 5 x Chopsticks 5 x Chopsticks Holder 1 x Sushi Knife 1 x Rice Paddle 1 x Rice Spreader 2 x Sauce Dishes 1 x Avocado Slicer 1 x Cotton Bag 1 x Instructions1 x Storage Gift Box Sushi Making Kit: Everything You Need to Know Are you a fan of sushi? Do you love the idea of making your own sushi at home? If you answered yes to both questions, then you'll definitely want to check out these amazing sushi making kits. With everything from sushi molds and knives to plates and rollers, these kits have everything you need to start making sushi like a pro. One of the most popular sushi making kits on the market is the smiletools sushi making kit. This kit includes several different molds for making different types of sushi, as well as a knife, plate, and roller maker. With this kit, you'll be able to make both nigiri and onigiri sushi, as well as traditional sushi rolls. To make sushi, you'll need a few basic ingredients. The most important ingredient is, of course, the sushi rice. You'll also need a variety of fillings, such as fish, vegetables, and tofu. Other ingredients you may want to include are nori (dried seaweed), wasabi (Japanese horseradish), and soy sauce. When it comes to making sushi, molds are key. Onigiri molds are great for making rice balls, and sushi rice molds are great for making traditional sushi rolls. This mold kit is perfect for a sushi boat train for the dining table. Our press for making sushi molds is a great sushi plate cooking kit. This kit includes everything you need to make sushi at home. With this kit, you will be able to make sushi rolls with ease. If you're looking for a more advanced sushi making kit, then the sushi roll maker tube making gadget gun is perfect for you. This kit includes a maquina de para hacer sushi roll, which allows you to make perfect sushi rolls every time. With this kit, you'll be able to impress your friends and family with your sushi making skills. Once you've made your sushi, you'll need a way to serve it. The sushi serving set is perfect for this. It includes everything you need to serve your sushi, including plates, chopsticks, and dipping bowls. Overall, a DIY sushi making kit is a great investment for anyone who loves sushi. With all the tools and ingredients you need, you'll be able to make sushi at home just like your favorite sushi restaurant. So why not try one out today?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+Am-w9IhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SmileTools","source_asin":"B09YV55J2B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YV55J2B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YV55J2B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
