window.products.push({"id":221936,"name":"AAAAAcessories Bench Cushions for Indoor Furniture with Ties, Non-Slip Bottom and Removable Cover, Indoor Seat Cushions Pads for Piano, Dining Bench a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KadqPJpNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfy & Ergonomic Support: Our powder-free high-resilience cushion foam is a leading filling that has excellent resilience and durability and can offer even support. Therefore, the bench cushion, 2'' in thickness, can provide a comfy surface and ergonomic support, protecting your tailbone, reducing pressure, and relaxing your muscles. With it, no more hard chair surfaces, and no more constantly adjusting your sitting posture to relieve the stiffness of sitting long. Non-slip Bottom & Ties: The bench cushion has a bottom with plenty of non-slip dots and also four 23.6'' ties to keep it absolutely in place during use. The double non-slip design perfectly prevents the cushion from sliding during use and will offer you a great using experience. Easy to Clean & Wash Tips: With a removable zippered cover, the cushion for bench is very easy to clean. Unzip and remove the cover and wash it by hand or with a washing machine (wash cold). Then just tumble dry with no heat or air dry. Please note that do not iron or bleach the cushion, and do not wash the foam insert. Durable & Attention to Details: Made of 250g/m² polyester fabric (a bit thicker than common fabric), the cushion cover is breathable, skin-friendly, and very durable. All the fabric edges have overlocking stitch design and won't get loose/broken easily, making the cushion more durable. In addition, the horizontal zipper of the cover, wrapped in the cover, won't scratch the furniture surface. Wide Use & Beautiful Decor: Ideal for spaces such as bay window seats, indoor sofas, piano benches, dining benches and floors. Can also be used for some commercial purposes. Besides, the simple solid-color style makes the cushion a perfect fit for furniture of various styles. The cushion measures 40''L×14''W×2''H. Please measure your furniture before ordering, and after unpacking the package, please allow about 48 hours for the cushion foam to rebound to its normal shape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KadqPJpNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AAAAAcessories","source_asin":"B0BN8XJPQX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN8XJPQX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN8XJPQX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
