window.products.push({"id":221985,"name":"Premium Black Hanging CD DVD Plastic Refill Sleeves for Aluminum Media Storage Cases 200 pcs Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A16rQmXXK4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This discs storage Sleeve with hanger is work for aluminum DVD storage case, hanger length 14.3cm.  To proper hang this sleeves, the inner space between two tracks must from 13.2 mm to 13.8 mm (anything greater or smaller will not work)   For use to hold the discs in the CD DVD carrying storage cases.  200 Sleeves in a pack (Quantity Variance Allowance: +-3%), hold 400 discs.  Black Color.  With blank sticker on the plastic hanger allow to write number on.  Double side plastic sleeve can hold 2 discs per sleeve.  Soft Black fiber in middle to separate discs to against any dust and scratch.  Sleeve Dimension: 5 x 5 1/2 Inches.  Note to Buyer:  No Custom Duty will apply to our customers in Canada and USA.  All orders are processed and shipped within 1-2 business days.  Shipments made to Canadian shipping addresses will be shipped via FedEx or Canada Post.  Shipments made to US shipping addresses will be shipped via USPS. Buyers can monitor the status of their orders using their tracking IDs.  If you have any questions/comments/concerns regarding the shipping delay please contact us through telephone or email before you consider to leave feedback. We try our best to maintain customer satisfaction at MegaDisc Store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A16rQmXXK4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atlantic","source_asin":"B00N26FS4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N26FS4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N26FS4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":221986,"name":"Le Creuset Silicone Honey Dipper, 6 1/2\" x 1\", Marseille","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iHQXvgfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed to fit perfectly inside the notched lid of Le creuset's stoneware Honey pot, this silicone Honey dipper makes a great gift for any tea lover, as well as a convenient way to enjoy Honey on waffles, yogurt, oatmeal, and more-without the sticky mess normally associated with dispensing Honey. The unit's stain-resistant, non-abrasive silicone head resists odor and flavor absorption and can withstand heat up to 482-degrees F (250-degrees C). and thanks to the flexible grooved design of the silicone head, it's just as easy to add a drizzle of rare black Sage to hot tea as it is to add a generous portion of winter white to a sweet dessert recipe. Another thoughtful detail includes the hanging hole at the end of the handle for space-saving storage when not in use. To clean, simply remove the silicone head and place it in the dishwasher or wash it by hand with warm, soapy water. The wood handle is not dishwasher-safe and should be washed by hand only. The Honey dipper measures approximately 6-1/2 by 1 by 1-inch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iHQXvgfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B001P5GIXC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001P5GIXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001P5GIXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":221987,"name":"HAUS AND HUES Desert Wall Art Nature Wall Decor - Landscape Wall Art Southwestern Decor for Wall | Desert Art Print and Southwest Prints Desert Pictur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BwBrF0YuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT THE SOUTHWESTERN LOOK: Get this Haus and Hues desert art wall decor and build around it to bring the Southwestern vibe into your space. Featuring a bird’s eye view of a vast peach-colored desert meeting the white foamy waves of the sea, this desert artwork reflects the relaxed and comfy vibe of Southwestern wall decor. Its neutral color palette captures the natural beauty of the desert and offers a relaxing sight in any space GALLERY QUALITY PRINTS: Haus and Hues desert wall decor and boho art prints are meticulously curated by our in-house creative team and made using the best art materials possible. We take extra measures to make sure that you will receive your art prints in pristine condition, so we package our nature posters and desert photos with chipboard pads and ship them in rigid Stay-Flat mailers to protect against damage while in transit PREMIUM QUALITY: To achieve the quality we’re known for, we use a giclée printing technique on 270 GSM solar white linen paper. The paper we use for boho prints is sourced in the US, and our inks are water-based and toxic-free. Our Pennsylvania oak frame adds the finishing touch to the scenic prints. It’s equipped with plexiglass covered by protective film and two metal hangers for horizontal or vertical hanging. The boho wall art is shipped in a durable box for protection while in transit. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Our in-house team ensures every Southwest art prints order passes our quality inspection to minimize misprints and order defects. We want you to shop our Southwestern decor for home with confidence, so we offer a hassle-free return and refund guarantee. If you're not satisfied with your purchase, let us know and we'll provide you with a full refund or replacement. A LOVELY GIFT: A THOUGHTFUL GIFT: Our abstract nature wall art will make a great gift for friends and family. Give your loved ones this bohemian wall art for a birthday, housewarming, graduation, Christmas, or any special occasion. This desert poster is a perfect way to add color and a personal touch to any space.Haus and Hues bohemian wall art and abstract nature wall art makes a great gift for just about any occasion. Give it to your family, friends, and colleagues so they can use it as living room decor, apartment wall decor, or bedroom wall art. Make your loved ones' birthdays, anniversaries, housewarmings, and graduations extra special by sending this beautiful art print as a gift","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BwBrF0YuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAUS AND HUES","source_asin":"B0916D3D86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-221987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0916D3D86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0916D3D86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
